# Cheesera Eterna Cinema 3D LUT (Adobe .cube format)
TITLE "Fujifilm Eterna Cinema 2x2x2 Sample"
LUT_3D_SIZE 2
DOMAIN_MIN 0.0 0.0 0.0
DOMAIN_MAX 1.0 1.0 1.0

# B=0
0.040 0.040 0.040 # Soft lifted cinematic black
0.900 0.060 0.040 # Muted red
0.050 0.880 0.050 # Muted green
0.910 0.890 0.060 # Soft warm midtone

# B=1
0.040 0.050 0.860 # Deep teal
0.890 0.060 0.870 # Soft lavender
0.050 0.890 0.880 # Soft cyan
0.950 0.950 0.940 # Highlight compression
